        <mxCell id="keyInsight" value="Mechanically identical to Pattern 005's GitOps flow — only the resource definitions change.&#10;&#10;Every Grafana Cloud resource (Stack, Folder, RBAC, LBAC, Notification Policy) is declared as code.&#10;&#10;Reverting a configuration is a git revert.&#10;&#10;No manual UI clicks. Ever." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=#F9FAFB;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#0F2A47;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
